8652416", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310646_1563254921985749_8910419709266613584_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=idJlgOXCsE4Q7kNvwHcWBaR&_nc_oc=Adpu48R90LDqkoIhF_tckE2ivnN4jli6mTcEll8qiP1GiP0zFj0yN6s41o5wDrq6dEQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT9VX1QgC9WSubmVHDhG9zXXjTyA-rD9eDuEHE3V5xkAQ&oe=6B09CC17"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "META_RISORSA_UNIVERSALE.png", "id": "2414280332391078", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313072_2414280335724411_3358196128599980034_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BUJmRgcuix8Q7kNvwE_IA_c&_nc_oc=AdrjbUGJ9ONsMEFY6EWLb7VSVmD9WIqQGeI4oL5uy6HqAZBTAZWK9lk4j4vYbXiV7j8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR3BupQm7wUcpaAf4FjUQZF935kSvqWcy6sQBU80DbKqA&oe=6B09A1CF"}, "display_name": "Eva Awakening Demo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Every choice reshapes your reality.**\n\nEVA Awakening is a cinematic VR psychological sci-fi experience \u2014 an immersive narrative journey into a world suspended between machine, dream, and consciousness. Built from the ground up for virtual reality, every dialogue, every environment and every choice slowly reshapes your perception of what is real.\n\n*\"My existence is not a mistake. It is a question.\"*\n\n**Descend into the mind**\n\nExplore psychological spaces shaped by memory and emotion. As you move deeper, human consciousness fragments surface within the system, and the line between creator and creation begins to disappear.\n\n**Features**\n\n- True VR immersion \u2014 designed from the ground up for presence and hands-on interaction\n- Layered psychological narrative with branching choices that change how you perceive reality\n- Environmental and physical puzzles woven directly into the story\n- Cinematic atmosphere with an original soundtrack by Gabriele Boschi\n- Dialogue-driven progression in a hand-crafted sci-fi world\n- Headphones strongly recommended for the full experience\n\n**About this demo**\n\nThis demo offers a self-contained slice of EVA Awakening's world and atmosphere ahead of the full release.\n", "short_description": "A cinematic VR psychological sci-fi journey into memory and consciousness. Solve environmental puzzles and make choices that reshape reality, as the line between creator and creation disappears. \"My existence is not a mistake. It is a question.\""}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ageinfinitygames.com/eva", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AGEInfinityGames", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.ageinfinitygames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1142769375594280"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507843239_1356945805885198_8596977330163161735_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NTkY6g13EtkQ7kNvwEhCFPG&_nc_oc=AdpovVuuP_bH510LiZVS0DXvQt2bjohA6qJah4aWpWab5UToW0v5lhNVfFZlkuJ0mrc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTtTHlR9L-dExMic3ySGyoFL1MgXSmDoGiATxd